Example: VPC endpoint policy for AWS Organizations actions

```
{
   "Statement":[
      {
         "Principal":"*",
         "Effect":"Allow",
         "Action":[
            "Organizations:DescribeAccount"
         ],
         "Resource":"*"
      }
   ]
}
```
